# The Sentinel Security Protocol (`The-Remote-Viewer`)

Open-source, decentralized, zero-trust application framework featuring in-process Solana execution via LiteSVM, 24/7 mesh synchronization, TTV Comms (Talk, Text, Video), and cryptographic brand protection for **The Sentinel** emblem.

## 🛡️ Architecture & Components
* **`sentinel-core`**: Core math, state accumulators, regulatory safe-harbor enforcement, and cryptographic brand verification.
* **`sentinel-mesh`**: Decentralized peer-to-peer gossip network and broadcast routing.
* **`sentinel-node`**: Main sovereign node daemon combining Solana LiteSVM execution with live mesh syncing.
* **`sentinel-ui`**: Terminal and GUI telemetry dashboard featuring Tier 1 Freemium TTV Comms with distance-based signal fading.

